This directory is for site-specific configuration scripts.

Any *.tcl files here will be sourced at startup before the
standard configuration calculations, allowing you to override
defaults like:

    screen_set DistanceToMonitor 55.0

Files are sourced in alphabetical order. Start from
monitor.tcl.EXAMPLE (copy it to monitor.tcl) for the screen size
and viewing distance.

The refresh rate is set outside stim2: STIM2_REFRESH in
/etc/default/stim2 on X11 rigs.

This directory is preserved across package updates.
